# PlutosAI — AI-Native Family Office Framework

An execution-ready blueprint to build an AI-native family office and asset management firm. This repository provides a modular framework spanning compliance, security, data, AI/ML, operations, client service, and infrastructure. Use it as a foundation to accelerate regulatory readiness, operational excellence, and AI leverage from day one.

## Vision

- **Client-first, AI-augmented**: Empower advisors and investment teams with copilots to deliver highly personalized, real-time insights.
- **Regulatory-grade from inception**: Design controls that scale with AUM and jurisdictional complexity.
- **Composable, cloud-first architecture**: Interoperable services, audited data flows, portable infra.

## Scope

This framework covers:

- Compliance and risk management baseline (Code of Ethics, P&P, AML/KYC, conflicts, valuation, best execution)
- Security architecture and policies (zero trust, IAM, secrets, vendor risk, IR/BCP)
- Data platform and governance (lakehouse, quality, lineage, retention, privacy)
- AI/ML platform and MLOps (model registry, evaluation, guardrails, RAI)
- Investment operations (portfolio accounting, OMS/EMS integration, reconciliation)
- Client service (CRM, onboarding, reporting, portal)
- Infrastructure-as-code (environments, CI/CD, observability)

